[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2223.51, "timestamp": "00:37:03", "text": "最后一刻才开始的。 嗯，我当时感觉自己根本没"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2227.99, "timestamp": "00:37:07", "text": "时间。 我当时有点忙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2229.91, "timestamp": "00:37:09", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2234.31, "timestamp": "00:37:14", "text": "我把所有东西都准备好，然后就做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2237.349, "timestamp": "00:37:17", "text": "。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2239.51, "timestamp": "00:37:19", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2243.27, "timestamp": "00:37:23", "text": "好的。 嗯，如果你要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2245.75, "timestamp": "00:37:25", "text": "问的话，Jo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2249.109, "timestamp": "00:37:29", "text": "明天会直播庆祝排灯节。 嗯，不太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2250.79, "timestamp": "00:37:30", "text": "确定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2254.23, "timestamp": "00:37:34", "text": "因为我还要上课什么的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2256.55, "timestamp": "00:37:36", "text": "。 说到这个，呃，直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2259.589, "timestamp": "00:37:39", "text": "时间到。 呃，我什么时候开始直播？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2263.109, "timestamp": "00:37:43", "text": "我的时代会是怎样的？ 呃，直播时间。 我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2265.75, "timestamp": "00:37:45", "text": "直播时间大概在这个时间段，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2269.349, "timestamp": "00:37:49", "text": "比如上午 10 点左右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2272.31, "timestamp": "00:37:52", "text": "我以前就是这么做的。 呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2275.589, "timestamp": "00:37:55", "text": "以前我直播的时候，比如参加 Joathon 之类的活动，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2277.349, "timestamp": "00:37:57", "text": "我都会选择特定的"}]